OL,3,GNEWSAScots denied bail after arrests in
OL,4,AAustralia ketamine raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Scots have appeared in court in
OL,7,FAustralia in after police seized more
OL,8,Fthan 100kg of a drug believed to be
OL,9,Fketamine.
OL,11,FJack Farrelly, 30, and Demi McDaid, 23,
OL,12,Fface charges of supplying a prohibited
OL,13,Fdrug in a large and indictable quantity
OL,14,Fafter being arrested at a hotel in
OL,15,FNorth Sydney last month.
OL,17,FOfficers from New South Wales police
OL,18,Ffound 105kg of drugs, believed to be
OL,19,Fketamine, in the boot of a rental car
OL,20,Fparked in the hotel car park.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
