OL,3,GNEWSAScots denied bail after arrests in
OL,4,AAustralia ketamine raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarrelly and McDaid were denied bail
OL,7,Fduring their brief appearance at
OL,8,FDowning Centre local court in Sydney on
OL,9,FTuesday. They are scheduled to appear
OL,10,Fagain on 11 September.
